  "family": "Google",
  "description": "Google's generalist image model, 0.5K to 4K. Keys: Google AI Studio, fal.ai or Replicate. Also on WaveSpeedAI. Also on Comfy Cloud. Also on ToAPIs. Also on OpenRouter. Also on Comfy Router. Adapter written from the provider's docs, not run against the live API yet.",
