          1024,
          2048,
          4096
        ]
      },
      "note": "Runs on ToAPIs (a reseller); not run against the live API yet. Crop, mask and references are uploaded to public files.toapis.com URLs. Instruction edit of the crop plus the reference layers, no mask input: the stitch keeps the selection. For area-directed edits set Fill to green and Original on, and say \"fill the green area\". The model takes aspect presets: a crop of another shape comes back re-framed and is centre-cropped. Channel official is Google's own cloud (Vertex AI); vip and standard cost less, and their image list form is not verified."
    },
