          2048,
          4096
        ]
      },
      "note": "Runs on OpenRouter (one key for many models); the adapter has run against the live API with GPT Image 2.5, this model not yet. The pictures go inline in the request to OpenRouter, which passes them to Google (AI Studio, which keeps data 55 days, or Vertex AI, which keeps none; OpenRouter picks). No mask input on OpenRouter: the mask goes along as a second picture and the prompt says what it means; the stitch keeps the selection anyway. An edit sends no aspect, so the host keeps the crop's shape as its own edit endpoint does (not verified); an answer of another shape is centre-cropped. Resolution auto takes the smallest tier that covers the crop."
    },
