      "note": "Runs on Comfy Router (api.comfy.org) with the Comfy Cloud key, billed in Comfy credits, no paid plan needed; not run against the live API yet. The pictures go inline in the request to Comfy, which passes them to Google's Vertex AI. No mask input: the crop and the mask go along and the prompt tells the model to change the white area only; the stitch keeps the selection. Size takes 1K, 2K or 4K (the Router's schema lists no 0.5K). At most fourteen pictures go in besides the mask."
